{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/71352","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/71352/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/71352/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/71352/events","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/71352","id":851536604,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU4NTE1MzY2MDQ=","number":71352,"title":"Dedicated voting-only nodes are defined incorrectly and may contain data","user":{"login":"DaveCTurner","id":5058284,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNTgyODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5058284?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner","html_url":"https://github.com/DaveCTurner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":23173,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzE3Mw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/%3Ebug","name":">bug","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":null},{"id":143077482,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDMwNzc0ODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/:Distributed/Snapshot/Restore","name":":Distributed/Snapshot/Restore","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"Anything directly related to the `_snapshot/*` APIs"},{"id":1967496670,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTY3NDk2Njcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/Team:Distributed","name":"Team:Distributed","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"Meta label for distributed team."}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2021-04-06T15:21:54Z","updated_at":"2021-04-06T16:52:38Z","closed_at":"2021-04-06T16:52:38Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Elasticsearch version** (`bin/elasticsearch --version`): 7.10-7.12 likely more. Still present in `master`\r\n\r\n**Description of the problem including expected versus actual behavior**:\r\n\r\nWe define a dedicated voting-only node as one with the `master` and `voting_only` roles but without the `data` role:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/e119ac60d46332065ac1f1b355c0528b7824f409/server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/repositories/RepositoriesService.java#L383-L386\r\n\r\nDedicated voting-only nodes are assumed not to do any snapshot operations: for instance they do not participate in repository verification or repository analysis. However now that we have other data-containing roles this logic no longer works: a node with `node.roles: [data_warm, master, voting_only]` is considered a dedicated voting-only node.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"DaveCTurner","id":5058284,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNTgyODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5058284?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner","html_url":"https://github.com/DaveCTurner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/71352/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/71352/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}